  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guarantee Facility Management Grant 2022-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant to the Investment Fund for Developing Countries (IFU) is for the establishment of the IFU guarantee unit and the setting up of and management of the Development Guarantee Facility, a pilot program (2022-2025) introducing development guarantees in Danish development cooperation. 

The present grant is contributed towards the period from mid-2022 to the end of the first quarter of 2023. For 2023 Q2 and Q3 administrations costs will be covered by a grant of 5.1 mil. DKK as outlined in the budget in section 5, less the guarantee fees received. It is envisaged that the remaining management costs for the remainder of 2023 to ultimo 2025 will be covered as yearly management grants combined with administration fees levied on guarantee beneficiaries.</narrative>
  </description>
